    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneV_37.1/p@127713",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "EGLAMOUR.\nThe sun begins to gild the western sky,\nAnd now it is about the very hour\nThat Silvia at Friar Patrick’s cell should meet me.\nShe will not fail, for lovers break not hours,\nUnless it be to come before their time,\nSo much they spur their expedition.",
